sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant T as TUI
    participant A as Analyzer
    participant RO as readonly
    participant BC as becareful
    U->>T: pick schema → table, type Row ID, Enter
    T->>A: analyze(table, id)
    A->>RO: BEGIN REPEATABLE READ READ ONLY + export snapshot
    loop root row, then each FK level (BFS)
        A->>RO: catalog / data query (in SAVEPOINT)
        alt 42501 / 57014 / 55P03
            A->>BC: same query on imported snapshot
            alt also fails
                A-->>T: DEAD END + both errors
            end
        end
    end
    A->>RO: ROLLBACK
    A->>BC: ROLLBACK
    A-->>T: verdict, tree, triggers, alerts
    T->>U: REPORT + OPTIONS
